            <ArticleTitle>Severe upper abdominal pain due to a large hepatocellular adenoma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>46-50</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A large hepatocellular adenoma was diagnosed in a female patient who was referred for severe upper abdominal pain. She had been using oral contraceptives over a period of 14 years. The clinical features, diagnosis and treatment are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
